<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Escelsa H1 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Escelsa H1 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian power firm Espirito Santo Centrais Eletricas SA, Escelsa, issued the following statement on its first half results.</p>
<p>	     H1 1996			H1 1995</p>
<p>    shr	42.31 reais		  17.05 reais</p>
<p>    net	25.3 million		     4 million</p>
<p>    revs     25.9 million		     4.1 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Per share figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 2324411</p>
</text>
